---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROVENANCE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The lists were compiled by merging several Azerbaijani dictionaries, keeping
the entries that are exactly five letters long and use only the 32 letters of
the Azerbaijani alphabet, then splitting them into common daily answers and
rare-but-accepted guesses.

The individual source dictionaries are third-party material.  Their exact
editions and licenses were not recorded at the time of compilation, so the
CC BY 4.0 license above covers **this compilation only** and does not claim to
relicense the underlying dictionaries.  If you intend to reuse these lists in a
way that requires certainty about the origin of every single word, verify the
sources first, or rebuild the list from dictionaries whose license you know.

If you are a rights holder and believe an entry should not be redistributed
here, please open an issue and it will be removed.
